description:
World Wars Tanks is a free online tactical tank arcade game dedicated to the major battles of World War II. Kpfw. IV; and the American M Sherman, M, M Lee, and others.
Choose one of four main factions:
USSR – durable and widely produced tanks with excellent cross-country ability;
Germany – powerful armor and highly accurate guns;
USA – balanced vehicles with good mobility and reliability.
UK – heavy armor and powerful guns.

Accurate 2D is a fun 2D game where the player must destroy all his enemies.

Features:
• many levels;
• casual gameplay;
• good graphics.

instructions:
• Tap the emoji that matches the word shown on the screen;
• Each round gets faster, so react quickly before time runs out;
• Build streaks to earn more points and reach higher scores;
• Be careful — one mistake and it's game over;
• Choose your favorite theme and see how far you can go!

Controls for smartphones:
• Hold your finger to make the Wave fly up;
• Don't press anything to make the Wave fly down.

Controls for computers:
• Hold the left mouse button/space to make the Wave fly up;
• Don't press anything to make the Wave fly down;
• Q - add a checkpoint in practice mode;
• E - delete the last checkpoint in practice mode;
• ESC / P / TAB - pause.

The goal of the game is to complete all the tasks, while annoying Granny.
PC controls:

WASD - move;
Shift - run;
Space - jump;
E - put/take;
F - interact;
LMB - throw/shoot.

Mobile device controls:
Right swipe - camera movement;
Left joystick - player movement.

Desktop
Movement - WASD keys;
Use - E or LMB;
Hint - H;
Shop - C;
Inventory - TAB;
Magic - Numbers.

Mobile - touch / swipe

description:
Siren head has attacked monster school and is hunting for the students!
The herobrine teacher saves the students and together they go through various challenges in an attempt to defeat the siren head and restore the school of monsters

- Funny memes and jokes;
- Fun easy levels;
- Diverse gameplay.

instructions:
PC (Mouse)
Hold the left button and move it.
Right - moving forward;
Left - backward movement;
Down - movement to the right, closer to the viewer;
Up - movement to the left, further from the viewer.
Space - jump

Mobile (Joystick)
Move the joystick
Right - moving forward;
Left - backward movement;
Down - movement to the right, closer to the viewer;
Up - movement to the left, further from the viewer.

description:
Drive a Moscow metro train, transport passengers, explore stations!
Metro lines:
- Kalininskaya (8) (Tretyakovskaya, Marksistskaya, Ploshchad Ilyicha, Aviamotornaya, Shosse Entuziastov, Perovo, Novogireyevo, Novokosino)

Trains:
- "Nomernoy" 81-717/714;
- "Oka" 81-760/761;
- Wagon type "E" 81-703;
- "Moscow" 81-765/766.

Informant: the real records of the informant of the Moscow metro.

Game Modes:
- Driver mode: control the Moscow metro train;
- Training: learn how to drive a train.

instructions:
Train control:
- Speed dial: move the controller on the left to the position "X1", "X2", "X3" or "X4";
- Speed reduction: move the controller on the left to the position "T1", "T2" or "T3";
- Start recording the informant: a button with a speaker on the bottom right;
- Doors: a button with doors on the bottom right (to open the doors, you need to be at the station, no more than 3 meters from the rail);
- Camera - camera button in the upper left corner;

Controls:
1. Cast/pull the rod - any mouse button (right/left);
2. Move left - "F" key;
3. Move right - "B" key.

Management:

On mobile devices:

Use the buttons on the phone screen.

On PCs:
- W-A-S-D keys to control the bus;
- Spacebar - handbrake;
- C - change camera view;
- G - horn;
- Q - left turn signal;
- E - right turn signal;
- Esc - pause.

⁃ Move with the joystick;
⁃ Come to the diapers to take them;
⁃ Come to the baby to change the diaper;
⁃ Take a bottle and go to the baby to feed;
⁃ Take the baby and go to the crib to put him to bed.

WASD - controlling the movement of a football player on the playing field.
If the ball belongs to a player, then:
Left arrow - pass to another player;
Up arrow - kick towards the opponent's goal;
The right arrow is the acceleration of the football player.

If the ball belongs to the opponent, then:
Left arrow - choose another player;
Up arrow - selection of the ball from the opponent;
Right arrow - following the player with the ball and further struggle.

Single player mode;
- WASD or Arrow Keys to move Hole

Two players mode;
- Player 1 use WASD
- Player 2 use Arrow keys
